        "text_RN8DXJ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At <strong>Zonoa</strong>, every piece is designed with care and attention to detail. We hope you love your purchase. However, if you’re not completely satisfied, we’re here to assist you.</p><h3>Returns</h3><ul><li>Returns are accepted within <strong>7 days of delivery</strong>.</li><li>Items must be <strong>unused, unworn, unwashed</strong>, and returned in their <strong>original packaging with tags intact</strong>.</li><li>Once the returned item is inspected and approved, a <strong>store credit or exchange</strong> will be issued.</li><li><strong>Cash refunds are not currently offered.</strong></li></ul><h3>Exchanges</h3><ul><li>Exchanges are subject to <strong>product and size availability</strong>.</li><li>If the requested item is unavailable, you may choose:Another product of <strong>equal value</strong>, or<strong>Store credit</strong> for future purchases.</li></ul><h3>Non-Returnable Items</h3><p>For hygiene and operational reasons, the following items are <strong>not eligible for return or exchange</strong>:</p><ul><li>Products purchased during <strong>sales or promotional discounts</strong></li><li>Any <strong>customized or altered items</strong> (if applicable)</li></ul><h3>Return / Exchange Process</h3><ul><li>Please contact us at <a><strong>support@zonoa.com</strong></a> within <strong>7 days</strong> of receiving your order.</li><li>Our support team will guide you through the return or exchange process.</li><li>Customers are responsible for <strong>return shipping costs</strong>, unless the product received is damaged or incorrect.</li></ul><h3>Damaged or Incorrect Products</h3><p>If you receive a <strong>damaged, defective, or incorrect item</strong>, please notify us within <strong>48 hours of delivery</strong> with clear photographs. Upon verification, we will arrange a <strong>replacement at no additional cost</strong>.</p>",
